WEBVTT

00:00.550 --> 00:04.140
This is Nuits Receipts, a receipt inbox you deploy yourself.

00:04.700 --> 00:08.900
It's open source, and it runs on Cloudflare Workers, in your own account.

00:09.500 --> 00:13.290
Forward a receipt by email, or upload a PDF or a photo.

00:13.900 --> 00:17.230
It reads the vendor, the amounts, the VAT and the date,

00:17.570 --> 00:20.000
and anything it's unsure about waits in Review.

00:20.560 --> 00:22.810
Import your bank statement as a CSV,

00:23.220 --> 00:26.630
or map any other layout, and payments are matched to their receipts.

00:27.200 --> 00:29.560
Likely matches are shown side by side,

00:29.950 --> 00:32.610
and the missing ones are listed, so you know what to chase.

00:33.170 --> 00:36.560
Home takes the month in three steps: check, match, send.

00:37.040 --> 00:39.860
You get a ZIP and a CSV for your accountant.

00:40.340 --> 00:41.700
Check them before you send them.

00:42.270 --> 00:45.990
AI usage is about fifteen cents a month at two hundred receipts.

00:46.530 --> 00:50.360
Reading PDFs needs Workers Paid, at five dollars a month.

00:50.910 --> 00:54.040
The code is on GitHub, under Apache 2.0.
